> *"Offline support and CI. The app now reads from a persisted cache with no network, queues writes, and replays them when the connection comes back. On the CI side, every pull request runs four checks in parallel and merging to main ships an OTA update automatically — with a guard that refuses to do that if the commit touched anything native."*
