> *"Two months ago I'd have said testing, honestly. I'd never worked somewhere with a strong testing culture. Now I've got unit, component and end-to-end coverage on a real project, plus a written document on what I deliberately don't test and why. It's still the area where I have the least production experience — but it's no longer an area I avoid talking about."*
